   "text": "Occasionally.",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "WIEGERT:",
   "text": "OK, were do you guys drinking before this?",
   "kind": "dialogue"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "BRENDAN:",
   "text": "No. (shakes head \u201cno\u201d)",
